WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:01.539
Speaker 1: All right.

00:00:01.539 --> 00:00:07.279
So here's what I have been building to with
this Trump getting booed for suggesting people

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:12.910
get vaccinated at his Alabama rally for months
now, really since the 2012 election, we've

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.759
been talking about how can we deprogram these
trumpets?

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:20.880
How can we bring tens of millions of people
back to having some semblance of a connection

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:26.150
with reality and so that they can be meaningful
participants in American society rather than

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.650
just people getting in the way that we have
to sort of get around in order to get anything

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:31.650
done.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:32.650
And we haven't been able to figure it out.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:36.870
And normally in history, when you look at
when there have been massive shifts in public

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:41.990
consciousness, when you look at massive cultural
shifts, massive when when things happen that

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:47.220
quickly, usually it's because some dictator
has come in and imposed an authoritarian,

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.230
dictatorial government.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:52.560
One of the greatest examples of this is the
Chinese Cultural Revolution, where you had

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:56.860
it wasn't that people's views just evolved
naturally, really quickly.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:05.420
It was that you had a dictatorial, authoritarian
government come in and say, this is the new

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:06.710
culture.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:10.500
That is not likely to happen in the United
States, so and that's good.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.630
And so absent that, the question we've been
asking is how do we bring these people back?

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:20.540
And I really thought a lot about this during
my trip to Europe from which I came back last

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:23.880
week because I was just in a place without
trumpets for a little bit.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.930
And it sort of gave me some context.

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:29.260
And my feeling is increasingly these people
are too far gone.

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:30.570
They can't be brought back.

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:32.990
Now, I'm not throwing in the towel.

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:36.680
I still think we continue to talk about it
and figure this out.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:41.150
But I do believe that for the most part, these
people are too far gone.

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.950
And then the cherry on top, I think, was at
the rally Saturday night in Alabama, where

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:50.210
Trump says to his own sycophants, I mean,
there's no greater suck ups for Trump than

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:53.850
the people that spend 12 hours waiting for
him at a rally.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:54.980
Trump says the vaccine is good.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.229
Go and get it.

00:01:56.229 --> 00:01:58.000
And then they jeer and they boo.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.310
I mean, this is the Trump that could shoot
people on Fifth Avenue and not lose his supporters.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:04.900
And he says the vaccine is good.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:05.900
Go and get it.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:06.900
And they boo.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.399
And he immediately has to backtrack.

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:12.139
I played this clip in the segment about the
rally, but let's just look at it one more

00:02:12.139 --> 00:02:14.790
time, three
Speaker 2: days, less than nine months.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:15.900
And it's great.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:16.900
And you know what?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.040
I believe totally in your freedoms.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.040
I do.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.209
You got to do what you have to do.

00:02:20.209 --> 00:02:22.019
But I recommend take the vaccines.

00:02:22.019 --> 00:02:23.329
I did it.

00:02:23.329 --> 00:02:24.329
It's good.

00:02:24.329 --> 00:02:25.329
Take the vaccines.

00:02:25.329 --> 00:02:26.790
But you got.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.989
That's OK, Tara.

00:02:28.989 --> 00:02:31.209
You got your freedoms.

00:02:31.209 --> 00:02:32.889
But I happen to take the vaccine.

00:02:32.889 --> 00:02:36.680
If it doesn't work, you'll be the first to
know.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:40.950
OK, I'll call up Alabama and say, hey, you
know what?

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.639
But it is working.

00:02:42.639 --> 00:02:44.269
But you do have your freedoms.

00:02:44.269 --> 00:02:46.319
You have to keep you have to maintain that.

00:02:46.319 --> 00:02:47.379
You have to maintain that.

00:02:47.379 --> 00:02:49.930
And you got to get your kids back to school.

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:53.430
Speaker 1: That sort of like game, set, match
for me, guys.

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:55.629
I mean, I'm ready to declare it.

00:02:55.629 --> 00:03:00.340
These people are too far gone to be brought
back at the mass scale level.

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:05.920
Now, at some micro level, we regularly hear,
you know, I've been working on my crazy cousin

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.739
for four, four months and now they've changed
their mind.

00:03:08.739 --> 00:03:09.969
That can happen.

00:03:09.969 --> 00:03:13.700
But at a mass scale, I don't know that we're
bringing these people back.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.639
And so Trump has really lost control of his
own monster.

00:03:17.639 --> 00:03:20.059
If he can't control it, nobody can.

00:03:20.059 --> 00:03:25.530
I use the analogy earlier of you get a protection
dog and it's so aggressive, it's dangerous

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.620
even to the owner.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.919
It's trying to protect you, lose control of
the dog.

00:03:29.919 --> 00:03:32.049
Mary Shelley's Frankenstein isn't.

00:03:32.049 --> 00:03:35.469
You know that these are these are the thoughts
that I'm having.

00:03:35.469 --> 00:03:39.199
And as I asked earlier, I think this is the
if correct me if I'm wrong, I think this is

00:03:39.199 --> 00:03:44.599
the first time a rally crowd has actually
booed something that Donald Trump said.

00:03:44.599 --> 00:03:48.730
And Trump really needed to be promoting the
vaccine in a more real way before he left

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:51.639
office between January 6th and January 20th.

00:03:51.639 --> 00:03:56.049
Not as I'm great because I got us the vaccine
and Biden will screw it up.

00:03:56.049 --> 00:03:57.419
But just everybody get it.

00:03:57.419 --> 00:03:58.419
It's safe.

00:03:58.419 --> 00:03:59.419
It's effective.

00:03:59.419 --> 00:04:02.779
It wasn't really available while Donald Trump
was still in office, but it's just too late

00:04:02.779 --> 00:04:03.779
for that.

00:04:03.779 --> 00:04:08.620
The damage was done and it shouldn't really
surprise us that now his own crowd boos him

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:14.029
when he says get vaccinated because Trump
refused to wear a mask in twenty twenty.

00:04:14.029 --> 00:04:17.380
He called it the China virus and a hoax.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:23.660
And Trump continued to do all of the things
that would encourage people ultimately not

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.260
to get vaccinated.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:29.030
And I don't think we can get him back at this
point in time.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:35.760
So sanity in the American right wing returning,
if we ever had it, is going to depend on young

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.370
people who aren't yet political.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:41.440
Now, hopefully we can pull those people left,
but if they end up on the right, maybe they

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.190
would be not crazy like these.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:49.340
Trump that's non Trump Republicans who maybe
can grow their share of the party.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.840
But I don't know that these tens of millions
of people can be brought back.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.650
Trump broke them and even he can't fix them.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.000
And that's really crazy.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:06.350
The vaccine now exists in this other America,
almost like this mark of the beast that they

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:08.010
talk about.

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.441
And some wrote to me saying, David, don't
worry about it.

00:05:10.441 --> 00:05:14.250
It's Darwinian, but it's really not, first
of all, because many of those people already

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:18.120
had kids and some of them even brought their
kids to this rally.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:22.490
Darwinian would be some trait that's disadvantageous
to reproduction.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:24.420
But a lot of these people have already reproduced.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:29.090
And then as far as the vaccines go, as I mentioned
earlier, I suspect one of the most effective

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:34.640
ways to get these people to get vaccinated
would be you say health care companies say

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:40.060
if you are unvaccinated and you need covid
treatment, you don't pay a copay.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.870
You straight up pay 50 percent of what it
costs.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.740
And that can be tens of thousands or even
hundreds of thousands of dollars.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.200
I think that gets a bunch of these people
to become vaccinated.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:53.300
But in some sense, a lot of this makes perfect
sense that this is the way they would feel

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:59.490
at this point, because for the last 18 months,
they were told covid is not real or it's real,

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.570
but it's not serious.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:04.420
We don't need to change anything about our
day to day.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.280
The vaccines may not work.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.940
The vaccine is experimental, Joe Biden will
force vaccinations.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:13.750
The vaccine might kill you, it might magnetize
you all this different stuff.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:18.100
And now, you know, in late August of twenty,
twenty one, Trump says the vaccine is good.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.100
Go and get it.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.760
In some sense, of course, they booed.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:22.760
What happens next?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.320
I have no idea.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:29.260
If you think these people are not too far
gone, I want to hear from you and tell me

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.140
exactly how we bring them back to reality.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:35.020
We'll have more on this on our Instagram,
which you can find The David Pakman Show.

